{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruling Horsestown\u00a0a choice-based comedy game where you must <span class=\"bb_strike\">survive</span> laugh and manage  a chaotic city.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the first horse mayor in history!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Horsestown, a chaotic city. Survive your 4 year term while dealing with ridiculous and impossible situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The people wanted to vote for the best mayor, but since there was no one better, they voted for a <strong>HORSE</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688510/extras/e4ffb1b606519640594fdcd34fa21470.avif?t=1773253611\" width=515 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688510/extras/bee4930734b2eadb9cab5055577a446d.poster.avif?t=1773253611\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688510/extras/bee4930734b2eadb9cab5055577a446d.webm?t=1773253611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each new turn, new problems land on your desk: political alliances, demands from the people, alien threats, and\u2026 buff horses? Your decisions will have <strong>consequences</strong>, keep an eye on your <strong>Popularity</strong>, <strong>Security</strong>, and of course, your <strong>Corrupt Money</strong>, as well as any other stats you find along the way.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make questionable choices</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the consequences across the city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your stats as best you can</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal money!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got abducted or something worse? Try again!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688510/extras/ee5efb80af807580c4a1b7330a286752.avif?t=1773253611\" width=340 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688510/extras/7fbcab2b5a2c56cf8b441f2eb65237d5.poster.avif?t=1773253611\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688510/extras/7fbcab2b5a2c56cf8b441f2eb65237d5.webm?t=1773253611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to face the unexpected: climate chaos, alien horse attacks, profit opportunities, and situations that defy all logic. In a city where anything can happen, it\u2019s up to you to try to keep order\u2026 or at least stall long enough to get out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688510/extras/2cfe17a80dff9bddb12fe6d1a429090c.webp?t=1773253611\" width=372 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each year brings a new theme, unlock them through your choices. Make a deal with the aliens and unlock the <strong>Year of the Aliens</strong>, or oppress your population and unlock the <strong>Year of the Dictatorship</strong>! Each one comes with its own problems, plus items and stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","backg